          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Visible use of drones and remotely guided/autonomous systems in attacks raises public and legislative alarm about weaponized and poorly-governed autonomy, prompting governments to accelerate proposals for stricter AI oversight, export controls, and operational constraints on autonomy-capable components." />
