          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Expanded central-bank market operations (liquidity provision, swap lines and asset purchases) reduce financing stress and FX volatility for multinational firms, lowering near‑term incentives to relocate production or capital expenditure across jurisdictions." />
