          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Large-scale reconfiguration or onshoring of supply chains raises near-term capital expenditure and lifts medium-term inflation expectations in affected economies, increasing demand for long-term finance and putting upward pressure on long-term nominal government yields." />
